{"channelId":"UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","row":["Washington German Shepherd Rescue",327,"Washington German Shepherd Rescue (WGSR) finds loving homes for surrendered, abandoned and neglected German Shepherd dogs in Washington state and the greater Pacific Northwest region.\n\nWe hope to ease the problem of population overflow occurring in many of our shelters today. WGSR educates the individual on the importance of sterilizing the pet and providing superior care.\n\nWGSR is composed of a network of foster families and volunteers.  We are always in need of more foster care providers with the time and commitment necessary to care for these animals in transition. We are also in need of volunteers who can shuttle dogs from shelters and other sites to our foster homes.\n\nIf you would like to adopt a German Shepherd dog or volunteer for our rescue, please visit our website today: http://www.washingtongsd.org/","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:39.462Z","channelId":"UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"babc78788b7ce1013e9c57954cd64ce3da7d31f6cac8d754d0494f8d3f0732dc","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"146abfe21639da7df683a55040430199ea8d09029d26d89524fcae4cd972e651"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:39.462Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":327,"raw":"327 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChKEVymPm-O5vmpc8gh2MeA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:39.462Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenc